00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.347
you're heavin' and hoein'--
Huffin' and puffin'.

00:09:33.601 --> 00:09:35.875
Heein' and hoein'?
I said heevin' and hovin'.

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:37.625
Heevin' and hovin'?

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:42.250
Yeah, before the governor

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:45.290
put in the stay-at-home provision

