That's a heave.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:49.723
Okay.

00:10:49.723 --> 00:10:51.390
That's the heave of the heave 'n huff.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.810
Now I think that's acceptable.

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:54.850
'Course, you can't go on trails.

