I don't know why we're doing that.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.023
No, hold on, take a deep breath.

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.513
And then if I just talk,
no, I'm breathing out.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.910
You gotta breathe out to talk.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.813
But talking is breathing out.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.940
Well I--
And then you do this.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.250
It lets you talk like this--
