00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:45.960
Did you memorize all that?

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:47.310
That's great.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.322
I wasn't reading.
That was really great.

00:19:49.322 --> 00:19:52.030
I've had a lotta time.

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:53.980
You're devoting all of this extra time

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:56.200
to memorization.

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.320
Right.
I mean,

00:19:58.320 --> 00:19:59.643
that is an idea.

